{"unit_id":"kolawong__dsh-plugin-auth-webserver#card-zh","repo":"kolawong/dsh-plugin-auth-webserver","commit":"8884b9b9b9a67ea3ac3a600b26c2edfaf5a27576","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-auth-webserver 为 DSH WebServer 添加网页登录与认证。它通过 bundle 补丁替换内置服务，提供中英双语登录页、Cookie 会话、命令行 Basic Auth 和 WebSocket 认证，并在 DSH Web 设置中提供凭据卡片。适合自行部署 DSH Web 并需要管理登录的用户；无需外部服务，可用环境变量或配置设置凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:167","index.js:319","index.js:575","index.js:2022","index.js:2119","client.js:519","cordis.patch.yml:11"]}
